# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
Visual RSI regime EA only — no trading.

## Regime (v1.16 CB sticky overlap)
- BEAR band 20–65: fail/bounce at 50–65 → SELL; leave only on close >65
- BULL band 35–80: hold/bounce at 35–50 → BUY; leave only on close <35
- Overlap 35–65 sticky (prior regime). Cap fails ×2 from neutral → SELL
- RSI@80 = bull ceiling, not sell
- History: 500-bar strips from sticky state

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Bg: OBJ_RECTANGLE_LABEL fullscreen (chart black)
- Boxes: body only (open/close), bull down→up green, bear up→down red

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(14), levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80, zone fills 35–40 & 60–65

## Docs
Phase_PRD.md + memory-bank/ — update on significant changes
